=== Episode 4: Desserts ===
The signature challenge tasked the bakers with making a beautifully decorated [[Pavlova (cake)|pavlova]] in 2 hours and 45 minutes. For the technical challenge, set by Prue, the bakers were asked to make 4 individual [[sticky toffee pudding]]s, served with sticky toffee sauce, 2 [[tuile]] triangles, and a [[Crème anglaise|creme anglaise]]. The bakers had 90 minutes. For the showstopper challenge, the bakers were given the task of making a celebratory [[Sponge cake|joconde imprimé]] dessert, composed of a highly decorated joconde sponge wrapped around at least 2 elements, in {{frac|4|1|2}} hours.{{sticky header}}{{table alignment}}
