=== Episode 9: Pâtisserie (Semifinals) ===
In the semifinal signature challenge, the bakers were tasked to make eight [[pâtisserie]]-style layered slices in 3 hours. For the technical bake, set by Prue, the bakers are tasked in making a Sablé Breton Tart, consisting of a [[Sablé (biscuit)|sablé]] breton pastry base, topped with raspberry [[confiture]], piped with pistachio [[Custard#In_French_cuisine|crème mousseline]], filled with fresh berries and topped with glided [[meringue]] [[Kisses (confectionery)|kisses]] and chocolate curls, all in two hours and forty-five minutes. A themed banquet display consisting of a crafted edible centrepiece surrounded by least twelve individual [[Entremet|entremets]] desserts was set as the showstopper. The bakers were given five hours.

