==Specials==
Two specials were commissioned for the festive season:

=== ''The Great Christmas Bake Off'' ===
The Great Christmas Bake Off featured [[It's a Sin (TV series)|It's a Sin]]'s [[Olly Alexander]], [[Nathaniel Curtis]], [[Lydia West]] and [[Shaun Dooley]].

The signature challenge required the bakers to make a Christmas Dinner's leftovers pie, in two hours, it can be made with any type of pastry, but the fillings must be made with leftovers from the baker's favorite Christmas Dinner. Prue's technical challenge tasked the bakers with making a chocolate [[Yule log (cake)|Yule Log]], in one hour and fifteen minutes. The bakers were given 3 hours to make a Christmas Tree out of biscuit or meringue for the showstopper challenge.
